1
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:07,080
[Fragments of Truth]

2
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,600
[Episode 10]

3
00:01:11,790 --> 00:01:12,640
What's wrong?

4
00:01:13,790 --> 00:01:15,040
My insomnia's worse again.

5
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:21,040
Yes. I've been dreaming
of my sister lately.

6
00:01:22,510 --> 00:01:25,430
I remember you said she raised you.

7
00:01:27,680 --> 00:01:29,230
Yeah...

8
00:01:29,310 --> 00:01:32,120
Some things kept me

9
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:34,120
from dreaming of her for years.

10
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,480
But somehow,

11
00:01:38,350 --> 00:01:41,310
those faded memories keep
getting clearer.

12
00:01:41,710 --> 00:01:42,790
I don't know why.

13
00:01:43,230 --> 00:01:45,120
Triggered memories
have two explanations:

14
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:47,510
the Proust effect

15
00:01:47,510 --> 00:01:48,870
and the hippocampal effect.

16
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,790
Familiar sensations

17
00:01:50,790 --> 00:01:54,230
and experiences can revive memories.

18
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:57,840
Neither applies?

19
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:02,230
Could something related to her
be happening to you lately?

20
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,150
I guess so.

21
00:02:07,950 --> 00:02:09,120
Or it could just be my imagination.

22
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:20,800
Here, take this.

23
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:24,910
What's this?

24
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:26,310
I told you:

25
00:02:26,310 --> 00:02:28,520
if the insomnia returns, come see me.

26
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,680
This is Tai'anmei,

27
00:02:30,870 --> 00:02:32,240
a grain extract

28
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:33,590
that helps with sleep.

29
00:02:33,590 --> 00:02:34,680
You can't buy it here.

30
00:02:35,910 --> 00:02:36,680
Does it work?

31
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:39,310
It's a popular supplement overseas.

32
00:02:39,310 --> 00:02:40,470
It has few side effects.

33
00:02:40,710 --> 00:02:41,680
Try it first.

34
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,030
If it works, come back for more.

35
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,470
Okay. Thanks.

36
00:02:46,190 --> 00:02:48,000
Remember, you owe me a drink.

37
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:49,190
Make it two.

38
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:52,680
[Donglin City Public Security Bureau
Criminal Investigation Detachment]

39
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:55,630
Come in.

40
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:01,800
That bloodstain in Shuguang Community
has been there for days.

41
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,280
It's also badly contaminated.

42
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,000
No human blood was detected on top.

43
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:07,910
There was one exception.

44
00:03:09,470 --> 00:03:12,590
Some blood underneath
seeped into the cement.

45
00:03:12,910 --> 00:03:14,120
It was well preserved.

46
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,710
Human blood, type AB.

47
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,910
The same type as Wogua.

48
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:21,630
And judging from the distribution,

49
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:23,470
the blood loss was substantial.

50
00:03:24,910 --> 00:03:26,310
That essentially confirms

51
00:03:26,590 --> 00:03:28,030
that before Wu Jia disappeared,

52
00:03:28,280 --> 00:03:30,120
he was injured inside that building

53
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:32,120
and may have been in mortal danger.

54
00:03:32,710 --> 00:03:33,190
Mm.

55
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:35,680
That's enough reason to open a case.

56
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,080
Please, have a seat.

57
00:03:39,190 --> 00:03:40,000
Sit wherever you like.

58
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:43,120
Would you like some water?

59
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:44,840
No, thank you.

60
00:03:48,430 --> 00:03:49,910
Did you take all these photos?

61
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:50,960
Well...

62
00:03:51,630 --> 00:03:53,030
I enjoyed photography when I was young,

63
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:54,470
but I didn't have much talent.

64
00:03:54,630 --> 00:03:56,400
Now it's just a hobby.

65
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:59,120
You're a teacher, right?

66
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:02,280
Not exactly.

67
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,470
I tutor students.

68
00:04:04,710 --> 00:04:05,470
Sorry.

69
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,000
May I ask,

70
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:09,030
are you here about Brother Wu again?

71
00:04:09,310 --> 00:04:10,590
Did something happen to him?

72
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,360
We're just gathering information.

73
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:14,080
We have a few simple questions.

74
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,280
Got it, got it.

75
00:04:16,630 --> 00:04:19,600
I don't really associate
with his family.

76
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:21,630
Brother Wu has a terrible temper.

77
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,000
I don't dare provoke him.

78
00:04:25,270 --> 00:04:27,630
What about Chen Yun?

79
00:04:28,630 --> 00:04:31,480
She rarely goes out.

80
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:32,630
I don't know her well either.

81
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,510
Hey, no, no!

82
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:58,120
This photo wasn't taken in your home.

83
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:02,680
Come with us.

84
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:07,280
[Interview Room 1]

85
00:05:11,510 --> 00:05:13,040
Tell us about these photos.

86
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:16,430
Yes, I took them.

87
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:19,390
I really like these photos.

88
00:05:20,270 --> 00:05:23,000
But I worried people would gossip,

89
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:25,270
so I hid them behind the frame.

90
00:05:25,390 --> 00:05:26,830
You were afraid we'd find them.

91
00:05:27,190 --> 00:05:28,720
You usually display the other side.

92
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:30,680
When did you two get together?

93
00:05:32,190 --> 00:05:33,000
No, no, no.

94
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:35,120
I admit I like her.

95
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:37,310
But at first, it was only sympathy.

96
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,480
I felt bad for Ms. Yun.

97
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,480
She's such a good person,

98
00:05:41,310 --> 00:05:43,310
and Brother Wu treated her so badly.

99
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:47,120
Her mental illness doesn't bother you?

100
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,800
Why would I mind?

101
00:05:51,190 --> 00:05:52,830
My own life is already a failure.

102
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,310
As long as you don't trigger her,

103
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,510
she's completely normal.

104
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:59,310
You can tell from the photos.

105
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:02,830
As long as Brother Wu doesn't bully her,

106
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:05,240
Ms. Yun could live happily.

107
00:06:05,720 --> 00:06:08,040
So Wu Jia found out about you two,

108
00:06:08,310 --> 00:06:09,720
and you killed him?

109
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:10,870
How could I?

110
00:06:11,270 --> 00:06:12,310
I'm an honest man.

111
00:06:12,430 --> 00:06:13,720
I could never do that.

112
00:06:14,510 --> 00:06:17,430
Besides, he didn't know I liked Ms. Yun.

113
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:18,870
When he was around,

114
00:06:20,630 --> 00:06:21,510
I didn't dare get close to her.

115
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:24,800
We've only grown close in recent days.

116
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,870
Because Wu Jia disappeared.

117
00:06:27,870 --> 00:06:29,310
So you got bolder?

118
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,510
If you put it that way,

119
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:34,630
I have no defense.

120
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:37,000
After I learned he was missing,

121
00:06:38,830 --> 00:06:40,720
I really did worry less.

122
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:42,310
You knew he wasn't coming back.

123
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:45,270
I really didn't know.

124
00:06:46,310 --> 00:06:48,040
But I never thought that far ahead.

125
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:49,600
All I wanted

126
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:51,830
was one happy day with Ms. Yun.

127
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:56,720
We now suspect Wu Jia is dead.

128
00:06:57,720 --> 00:07:00,070
And you're our prime suspect.

129
00:07:02,510 --> 00:07:05,040
Officer, I know I'm a suspect.

130
00:07:05,310 --> 00:07:07,190
But I really know nothing about this.

131
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:10,830
People say the building is haunted.

132
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:14,800
I don't know if it
relates to Brother Wu.

133
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,070
After all that,

134
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,390
not one useful thing.

135
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:21,480
Any leads on the source

136
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,480
of the haunting rumors?

137
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:25,480
It seems they began two
or three years ago,

138
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:27,720
spread by residents of the complex.

139
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:30,480
Then influencers jumped on the trend

140
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:31,830
and went there to film explorations.

141
00:07:31,830 --> 00:07:34,870
They even blamed the ghost
of Chen Yun's miscarried baby.

142
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,600
They posted her photo online too.

143
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:39,430
Let's go see her.

144
00:09:09,030 --> 00:09:10,030
Any new findings?

145
00:09:10,870 --> 00:09:11,720
Here's what we found.

146
00:09:12,030 --> 00:09:13,240
After the victim was injured,

147
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:15,200
no blood was found on other floors.

148
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:17,910
The killer probably covered his wound
before moving him.

149
00:09:18,030 --> 00:09:20,080
If they used a tool to move him,

150
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:22,000
it likely left marks on the stairs

151
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,000
or the walls.

152
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:24,720
Look at this one.

153
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:32,030
This mark looks fairly fresh

154
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:33,320
and is quite scattered,

155
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:34,510
but it wasn't made just now.

156
00:09:34,910 --> 00:09:37,440
A suitcase couldn't have caused it.

157
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:41,120
The stairs above have
several scuff marks.

158
00:09:41,120 --> 00:09:43,320
They're deep, even after several days.

159
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:44,390
It's hard to find anything else.

160
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,870
And at both suspects' homes,

161
00:09:47,150 --> 00:09:48,320
we found nothing.

162
00:09:49,870 --> 00:09:50,840
Let's check upstairs.

163
00:11:30,390 --> 00:11:31,600
Captain Ren, Uncle He.

164
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:32,870
Come here for a moment.

165
00:11:35,200 --> 00:11:36,000
Captain Ren, Uncle He.

166
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:37,270
What's going on?

167
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:39,200
This room's lock was forced.

168
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,320
The lock was forced.

169
00:11:40,390 --> 00:11:42,000
The room has been ransacked.

170
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:43,840
The window is open too.

171
00:11:44,630 --> 00:11:45,480
What are you looking for?

172
00:11:46,270 --> 00:11:46,750
Drag marks.

173
00:11:47,790 --> 00:11:49,080
Marks from moving something heavy.

174
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:50,080
There are marks by the door too.

175
00:11:51,670 --> 00:11:52,910
Of all the rooms we've checked,

176
00:11:53,320 --> 00:11:54,390
this one fits best.

177
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:06,360
Boss.

178
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:06,840
Mm.

179
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:08,240
Call Hao Jun over.

180
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,030
Okay.

181
00:12:46,580 --> 00:12:48,640
♪I stand in a fire-tempered jungle♪

182
00:12:48,640 --> 00:12:50,590
♪Withered leaves fall
as my strength runs dry♪

183
00:12:50,590 --> 00:12:52,500
♪Dust swirls as I clench my fists♪

184
00:12:52,500 --> 00:12:54,310
♪I strategize, my faith my armor♪

185
00:12:54,310 --> 00:12:56,640
♪My defiance spills onto concrete♪

186
00:12:56,640 --> 00:12:59,070
♪Even thick fog can't hide
my clear gaze♪

187
00:13:02,210 --> 00:13:04,120
♪Let neon turn to thorns♪

188
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:06,010
♪Flying low as the stars shift and turn♪

189
00:13:06,020 --> 00:13:07,960
♪Escape the maze,
transcend the challenge♪

190
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:10,080
♪The meter starts, breaking the silence♪

191
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:12,090
♪A beam cuts through
a crack in the wall♪

192
00:13:12,090 --> 00:13:14,260
♪This rhythm and noise
echo through the streets♪

193
00:13:17,850 --> 00:13:21,330
♪Don't be afraid. No one will answer♪

194
00:13:21,330 --> 00:13:24,700
♪Why is that child crying?♪

195
00:13:24,930 --> 00:13:27,400
♪The shrinking scar on my arm♪

196
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:29,020
♪Means I've grown up♪

197
00:13:29,020 --> 00:13:32,170
♪You can trust me when I say that♪

198
00:13:32,170 --> 00:13:35,650
♪The wound still aches♪

199
00:13:36,060 --> 00:13:40,410
♪Like a biting winter♪

200
00:13:40,410 --> 00:13:43,680
♪But a spark still glows♪

